   \[
   \text{Mass of NaF} = \frac{0.044 \text{ g}}{100 \text{ mL}} \times 10 \text{ mL} = 0.0044 \text{ g}
   \]

3. **Convert grams to milligrams:**
   \[
   \text{Mass of NaF} = 0.0044 \text{ g} \times 1000 \text{ mg/g} = 4.4 \text{ mg}
