[CN$^-$] = +x
[Fe(CN)6^{4-}] = +x

Equilibrium concentrations:
[Fe$^{3+}$] = 1.0 - x
[CN$^-$] = 0 + x
[Fe(CN)6^{4-}] = 0 + x

