\Delta S = [133 + 496.4] - [182.4 + 615.3]
\]

\[
\Delta S = 629.4 - 797.7
\]

\[
\Delta S = -168.3 \text{ J/mol K}
\]

Thus, the entropy change for the given reaction is \(\boxed{-168.3 \text{ J/mol K}}\).
