- \( T_2 = \frac{1}{0.0012} \approx 833.33 \, \text{K} \),
- \( R = 2 \, \text{cal K}^{-1} \text{mol}^{-1} \).

\[
E_a = \frac{\ln \left( \frac{10^4}{10^{-1}} \right)}{\frac{1}{2 \times 555.56} - \frac{1}{2 \times 833.33}}
\]

\[
E_a = \frac{\ln (10^5)}{0.00283 - 0.00120}
\]

\[
E_a = \frac{15.099}{0.00163}
\]

\[
E_a \approx 9270 \, \text{cal K}^{-1} \text{mol}^{-1}
\]

