\]  
The r.m.s. voltage is:  
\[
V_{2,rms} = \frac{1}{2} \sqrt{\frac{1}{2\pi}} \left| \frac{1}{2} \mu_0 I_0 \frac{N_2 \ell}{A} \right| = \frac{1}{2} \sqrt{\frac{1}{2\pi}} \frac{1}{2} \mu_0 I_0 \frac{N_2 \ell}{A}
\]  

